   "updated": 1793930162139,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "\u2022 Injected: NGINX stopped on node2 (VM up).\n\u2022 Refused connection \u2192 same request retried on node1\n   (retries + redispatch); health check DOWN in ~9 s.\n\u2022 keepalived: no change.\n\u2022 Measured: 0 failed, no gap.",
   "originalText": "\u2022 Injected: NGINX stopped on node2 (VM up).\n\u2022 Refused connection \u2192 same request retried on node1\n   (retries + redispatch); health check DOWN in ~9 s.\n\u2022 keepalived: no change.\n\u2022 Measured: 0 failed, no gap.",
